      "name": "Advertised vs. Actual SLA",
      "description": "Comparison of vendor\u2011published service\u2011level agreements (uptime, latency guarantees, data durability) against third\u2011party monitoring data and customer\u2011reported incidents. \u3010doc:sla_analysis\u3011"
