        "step": "Execute Controlled Tests",
        "actions": [
          "Provision trial accounts for each platform in a sandbox environment.",
          "Run automated incident injection scripts and record detection \u2192 remediation timestamps.",
          "Measure throughput (events/sec) and resource utilization."
        ]
      },
      {
        "step": "Analyze Pricing & SLA Alignment",
        "actions": [
          "Map advertised pricing tiers to actual usage from test runs.",
          "Cross\u2011reference SLA guarantees with observed latency and uptime logs.",
          "Identify any variance and calculate cost per minute of MTTR reduction."
